# Test Files Directory

This directory contains test files used for development and testing.

## Structure

- `pdf/` - PDF test files (scanned documents, multi-page PDFs, etc.)
- `images/` - Image test files (JPG, PNG, DNG, etc.)
- `output/` - Generated output files from tests (should be gitignored)

## Usage

Place test files here for local development and testing. These files are typically not committed to the repository.
